{"5300840":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Final Depth","steam_appid":5300840,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Depth is a traditional roguelike about a dungeon that remembers you.<\/strong> Descend one turn at a time through a branching, permanently generated dungeon — every floor you leave stays exactly as you left it, corpses and all. Die, and it's all over: permadeath, no take-backs, no grinding your way back to where you fell.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just pushing deeper — you're racing the dungeon itself. Linger too long on a floor and its reinforcement clock ticks toward more monsters, not fewer. Loud fights draw in the neighbors. The only way out is down, and the only way down is through.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from five ways to fight: the berserker's charge-and-cleave brutality, the bishop's smiting and healing, the space wizard's gravity-bending spellbook, the vagrant's scavenger's toolkit, or the wolf — a hero with a second body. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One main dungeon branches out into five distinct biomes — the drowned depths, the fungal grove, the undead catacombs, the frozen ice caverns, the molten lava caverns — each with its own monster roster, its own terrain, its own boss, and its own music.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent, persistent floors<\/strong> — a branching  plus five themed side-branches, procedurally generated every run.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True permadeath<\/strong> — one life, one run. Can you make it to the end?<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five classes <\/strong>— hand-place or roll your starting attributes, then grow through class abilities, talent trees and gear you find along the way.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dungeon that pushes back<\/strong> — a per-floor reinforcement clock, noise-scaled monster hearing, and elite variants punish camping and reward moving with purpose.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full spellcasting<\/strong> — bolts, area spells, and utility magic aimed at a body, a spot on the floor, or yourself.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living audio<\/strong> — every spell, every monster's death rattle, every footstep synthesized and authored so combat never sounds quite the same twice, layered under a score that shifts biome to biome.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shops, chests, and real loot<\/strong> — rare keepers who'll buy and sell, treasure chests worth prying open, and gold piles that grow visibly with their worth.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full keyboard\/mouse and gamepad support<\/strong> — fully rebindable controls, automatic input-scheme switching, and a controller action wheel for spells and abilities.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Depth is a traditional roguelike about a dungeon that remembers you.<\/strong> Descend one turn at a time through a branching, permanently generated dungeon — every floor you leave stays exactly as you left it, corpses and all. Die, and it's all over: permadeath, no take-backs, no grinding your way back to where you fell.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just pushing deeper — you're racing the dungeon itself. Linger too long on a floor and its reinforcement clock ticks toward more monsters, not fewer. Loud fights draw in the neighbors. The only way out is down, and the only way down is through.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from five ways to fight: the berserker's charge-and-cleave brutality, the bishop's smiting and healing, the space wizard's gravity-bending spellbook, the vagrant's scavenger's toolkit, or the wolf — a hero with a second body. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One main dungeon branches out into five distinct biomes — the drowned depths, the fungal grove, the undead catacombs, the frozen ice caverns, the molten lava caverns — each with its own monster roster, its own terrain, its own boss, and its own music.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent, persistent floors<\/strong> — a branching  plus five themed side-branches, procedurally generated every run.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True permadeath<\/strong> — one life, one run. Can you make it to the end?<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five classes <\/strong>— hand-place or roll your starting attributes, then grow through class abilities, talent trees and gear you find along the way.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dungeon that pushes back<\/strong> — a per-floor reinforcement clock, noise-scaled monster hearing, and elite variants punish camping and reward moving with purpose.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full spellcasting<\/strong> — bolts, area spells, and utility magic aimed at a body, a spot on the floor, or yourself.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living audio<\/strong> — every spell, every monster's death rattle, every footstep synthesized and authored so combat never sounds quite the same twice, layered under a score that shifts biome to biome.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shops, chests, and real loot<\/strong> — rare keepers who'll buy and sell, treasure chests worth prying open, and gold piles that grow visibly with their worth.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full keyboard\/mouse and gamepad support<\/strong> — fully rebindable controls, automatic input-scheme switching, and a controller action wheel for spells and abilities.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Navigate through the dungeon in this modernized traditional fantasy roguelike fighting monsters, gathering loot and leveling your character as you try to make it to the Final Depth.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/2f143bcb1869cd361d6fb75f872da0c782f37f59\/header.jpg?t=1793724457","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/f15606ebaa91955ca5065a8325e913a182581e70\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793724457","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/f15606ebaa91955ca5065a8325e913a182581e70\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793724457","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit (version 1809 or later)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-4130 \/ AMD FX-4300 (any 64-bit dual-core, 2.0 GHz+)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 \/ NVIDIA GeForce GT 430 \/ AMD Radeon HD 5450 — OpenGL 3.0 support required<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any Windows-compatible audio device<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1280×720 display. Keyboard and mouse, or an XInput-compatible controller. The .NET runtime is bundled; no separate install needed.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-6400 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620 \/ NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 \/ AMD Radeon R7 260 — OpenGL 3.3 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any Windows-compatible audio device<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1920×1080 display at 60 Hz. Xbox or PlayStation controller supported, with rumble.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["QuickBigly"],"publishers":["QuickBigly"],"demos":[{"appid":5478870,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":815,"final":733,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"8,15€","final_formatted":"7,33€"},"packages":[1832344],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Final Depth","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1832344,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Final Depth - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">8,15€<\/span> 7,33€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":733}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":75,"description":"Keyboard Only Option"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":56,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":77,"description":"Touch Only Option"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/2e5a3d6d184d2572f62ab1793159607cf5664e66\/ss_2e5a3d6d184d2572f62ab1793159607cf5664e66.600x338.jpg?t=1793724457","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/2e5a3d6d184d2572f62ab1793159607cf5664e66\/ss_2e5a3d6d184d2572f62ab1793159607cf5664e66.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793724457"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/3f1b7fbdc9a0e8d87fa1fa77655c5789ed7e7140\/ss_3f1b7fbdc9a0e8d87fa1fa77655c5789ed7e7140.600x338.jpg?t=1793724457","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/3f1b7fbdc9a0e8d87fa1fa77655c5789ed7e7140\/ss_3f1b7fbdc9a0e8d87fa1fa77655c5789ed7e7140.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793724457"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/3467b48d524926f5ba01c712bba3c58413260e70\/ss_3467b48d524926f5ba01c712bba3c58413260e70.600x338.jpg?t=1793724457","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/3467b48d524926f5ba01c712bba3c58413260e70\/ss_3467b48d524926f5ba01c712bba3c58413260e70.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793724457"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/fc5245a61556b1bcd7eb7200e19a0548fbb09dce\/ss_fc5245a61556b1bcd7eb7200e19a0548fbb09dce.600x338.jpg?t=1793724457","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5300840\/fc524